-- Every value is from Wall 12100, 12101, 12102, 12103, 12105, 12108, 12127, 12129, 12139, 12145 and 12152, ask652/w4/plan652.md rev 1 (head read by W3; the plan was read whole before the manual entry) (each read whole by W3), W4's facts file aar/w3/cards_641_to_652_from_w4.md (md5 380e6b134460a413f6f57ea766452fc7), and md5sum by W3 of the files named.
-- NOT READ by W3: the card and the press in W4's thread (taken from W4's facts file); the audit_log row; the live engine and n8n; W1's grade files in git; plan rev 0 (bce5be7f), overwritten by rev 1.
-- objective_met is 'in part': written and read back; no run since the write.
